sequenceDiagram
    participant KServe as KServe v2 Model<br/>Inference Source
    participant ModelMesh as ModelMesh<br/>Partial Payloads
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>FastAPI (HTTP)
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>PVC (h5py) / MariaDB
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Metrics Scraping

    Note over TrustyAI: No auth middleware registered<br/>All 87 endpoints unprotected at app level<br/>Auth expected via external enforcement

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over KServe, Storage: Inference Ingestion Flow
        KServe->>TrustyAI: POST / (CloudEvent)<br/>Header: ce-id<br/>KServe v2 inference payload
        TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Reconcile input/output pairs<br/>Match by inference ID
        TrustyAI->>Storage: Persist paired observations<br/>h5py HDF5 or MariaDB
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Write confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over ModelMesh, Storage: ModelMesh Ingestion Flow
        ModelMesh->>TrustyAI: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>Partial input/output payloads
        TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Reconcile partial payloads<br/>Match input ↔ output pairs
        TrustyAI->>Storage: Persist reconciled data
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Write confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over TrustyAI, Storage: Direct Data Upload Flow
        Note right of TrustyAI: Client uploads paired<br/>request/response data
        TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: POST /data/upload<br/>Paired payload
        TrustyAI->>Storage: Delegate to consumer<br/>reconciliation flow
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Write confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over TrustyAI, Prometheus: Metrics Computation Flow (On-Demand)
        Note right of TrustyAI: Client requests metric<br/>computation
        TrustyAI->>Storage: Read observation data<br/>for target model
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Historical observations
        TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Compute metric<br/>SPD / DIR / KS Test /<br/>Jensen-Shannon / Fourier MMD /<br/>Compare Means / Mean Shift /<br/>Batch Mean / Identity
        TrustyAI-->>TrustyAI: Return metric result (JSON)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over TrustyAI, Prometheus: Scheduled Metrics Publishing
        TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: PrometheusScheduler triggers<br/>scheduled metric computation
        TrustyAI->>Storage: Read observation data
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Historical observations
        TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Compute scheduled metrics
        Prometheus->>TrustyAI: GET /q/metrics<br/>Scrape Prometheus endpoint
        TrustyAI-->>Prometheus: Prometheus-format metrics
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over TrustyAI, Storage: Metadata Query Flow
        Note right of TrustyAI: Client queries model info
        TrustyAI->>Storage: Read model metadata<br/>GET /info
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Observation counts,<br/>schemas, metric schedules
        TrustyAI-->>TrustyAI: Aggregated metadata (JSON)
    end
